{"id":"wb-6-546","name":"普陀山多宝塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"普陀山多宝塔","text":"多宝塔又名太子塔，位于浙江省舟山市的普陀山岛普济禅寺的东南方。塔建于元代，是普陀山上保存至今的最古的建筑，也是现存的元代最大的宝箧印式塔，现被列为全国重点文物保护单位。太子塔造型雄健，装饰美观，与普济寺钟声形成普陀山十二景之一的“多宝闻钟”。\n多宝塔与杨枝观音碑、九龙藻井合称为“普陀山三宝”。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%99%AE%E9%99%80%E5%B1%B1%E5%A4%9A%E5%AE%9D%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86785915,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86785915","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/82caa0f3d23bd04a0abd3722.jpg","title":"Duo_Bao_Pagoda_2019-05-11_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Duo_Bao_Pagoda_2019-05-11_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/Duo_Bao_Pagoda_2019-05-11_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​普陀山多宝塔","width":320,"height":479}}